cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt Continuity of Care, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "Continuity of Care: A Human-First AI Workspace Practice Library"
abstract: >-
  A platform-neutral, Markdown-only practice library for maintaining accurate
  context across AI assistants, sessions, projects, and tools. It is designed
  to help social workers, educators, organizers, clinicians, and other
  non-technical professionals use AI with continuity while preserving human
  judgment, privacy, accessibility, safety, and ethical accountability.
